  :authoritative_for
  ["which reserve assets etzhayyim may hold: Tier-1 on-chain {USDC, EURC (Circle), JPYC (JPYC株式会社)} on Base L2; Tier-2 CBDC {e-CNY (PBOC); digital euro / digital yen placeholders} attestation-observed"
   "USDT is structurally excluded (owner decision 2026-07-02); readmission = Council Lv7+ unanimity + ADR amendment"
   "HAKARI (秤) is an SDR-style basket UNIT OF ACCOUNT only — never minted as a token (Alt C / Charter Rider §2(b) intact)"
   "Tier-2 CBDC carries weight 0 until Council Lv7+ unanimity activation; basket NAV renormalizes over active assets"
